# Kimi K3 gate evidence fetched from the Modal volume.
#
# Every gate writes its artifact into the volume and it is pulled back with
# `modal volume get` into a directory named for the run. Those are generated
# outputs of a measurement, not sources: they are large, they are not
# reproducible from the tree, and a diff that carries them buries the change
# that produced them. The numbers that matter are read out of them and written
# into the Task 11b report instead.
/kimi_k3_*/

